  description: 'Legend of Setekh, an ancient warrior who has lived for over four
    hundred years. No one knows the secret to his long life, but he is deeply respected
    as a follower of the Golden Path also known as the religion that worships Khar,
    god of Strenght and Competition. Colloseum of Setekh was built under Azgor''s
    order during his Conquering years as a gift to Kord hundred years ago. Each year
    in Kord''s name, a tournament is being held in which criminals fight to the death
    and their blood becomes a tribute to the God. '
